{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u82f1\u8bed\u6807\u9898.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is A Post-apocalyptic, High-Freedom, Sandbox Survival Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a near-future wasteland, resources are scarce, and danger lurks at every corner. You play as a survivor, scavenging, crafting, and exploring the open world in search of ways to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u4eba\u7269\u4ecb\u7ecd.png?t=1752806360\" /></div>Along the way, you will encounter NPCs who are also struggling to survive in this harsh environment. You can choose to cooperate or confront them, help the weak or plunder others... Every decision you make will shape your unique journey through the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u82f1\u65872.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic NPC World</strong> <br>The game features randomly generated NPCs who make decisions based on their needs and past experiences, such as cooperation, trade, revenge, or plunder. Each NPC can become either your ally or your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/NPC.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/NPC\u56f4\u653b.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u82f1\u65873.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High-Freedom Gameplay</strong><br>Explore a seamless, open-world sandbox map, discover resource points, engage in trade, and craft equipment. (Coming soon) Alternatively, you can join different factions and enforce your own survival rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u91c7\u96c61.gif?t=1752806360\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u82f1\u65874.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-time Combat System</strong><br>The real-time combat system requires you to strategically equip yourself and your NPC companions with the right weapons and gear to overcome various enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u6b66\u56681.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u82f1\u65871.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trading and Economic System</strong><br>In addition to raiding enemy resource points for supplies, you'll need to understand market shifts caused by supply and demand to find the best strategies for survival in the resource-scarce wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u4e70\u5356\u4ea4\u6362.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u82f1\u8bed6.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Item Crafting</strong><br>By exploring and trading materials, you can craft advanced equipment to ensure the survival of yourself and your companions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u82f1\u8bed\u5408\u6210.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263410?t=1752806360","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263410?t=1752806360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/b1452e8d3a5f500df0414543e64481c14d48c169/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752806360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/b1452e8d3a5f500df0414543e64481c14d48c169/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752806360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263410/extras/\u82f1\u8bed\u6807\u9898.png?t=1752806360\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is A Post-apocalyptic, High-Freedom, Sandbox Survival Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a near-future wasteland, resources are scarce, and danger lurks at every corner. You p